  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening health infrastructure and governance for inclusive care in Agadez</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports Niger&apos;s Ministry of Health and Public Hygiene in strengthening and promoting the health of local and migrant populations in the Agadez Commune Health District, an area facing significant migratory pressure and multiple health, social, and environmental challenges. The initiative responds to the priorities of Niger&apos;s Health and Social Development Plan (PDSS 2022-2026) and Agadez&apos;s priorities for development and stabilization.</narrative>
  </description>
